        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo na nīmo gokwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū nene Paulo nalīng'wikūmbīlīja kūlwa būfula na wiyūmīlīja bo ng'wa Kilisito; nene ng'wenekīlī ūyo mūkūnibonaga gīkī nalī ng'ooba wa booba ū kū bing'we ūlū nalī hamò ning'we, alīyo ūlū natīho nalī ngimu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū haha aho natī hamò ning'we, nalīng'wikūmbīlīja ūlū nalize ko mutizūnenheleja kūgima, nakabūtūmamīla ū būgimu ūbo namanile gīkī nalī nabo kū bamò, abo bakūtwiganikīlaga gīkī tūkūshimīzīlaga mu nhūngwa ja mu mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ni tūbizage tūlī banhū ba mīlī, alīyo tūtalwaga gītī banhū ba nhūngwa ja mu mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī shilanga shise shitī mu nguzu ja mīlī, alīyo shilī mu nguzu ja ng'wa Mulungu. Shidūgije kūkambagūla ng'hambī ja banishi, kūgwisha maganiko ga bahalalī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na būlī shose shose īsho shikigūngūhyaga kūlwa kūbahangīja banhū batizūmana Mulungu. Na hangī shilī na būdūla bo kūdima būlī iganiko, na kūlītūūla ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū wigwi wing'we ūlū būlashikane, a bise tūmalīīlile kūwinha nsango pyī ū būshitiigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mukwībabataga ī mihayo higūlya gūlya gīt'ūmo mukwībonelaga; ūlū alīho munhū imanile gīkī alī wa ng'wa Kilisito, ni agūmanage nū gwenūyū nago, gīkī na a bise tūlī ba ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nūūlū nakabiza gītī naja no ū mu wikumīlīja kūlwa būdūla wise ūbo watwinha Seeba, gīkī tūmuzenge, tūtizūmusambagūla, nahene natūgooka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene natatogilwe niganikīlwe gīkī nakūmukangaga ū mu nyalūba jane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bangī bakūhayaga gīkī, “Ahene ū ng'wing'wana ī nyalūba jakwe jilī na ntili, nīyo jilī na nguzu; lelo ūlū ūmona ū wei ng'wenekīlī, nyangīlīzu o banyangīlīzū, hama nī mihayo yakwe migokolo ya nyaleele leele!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo akwiganikaga gīko ni amanage gīkī, ūmo tūlī ū mu nyalūba ūlū tūlī ndūhū, h'ūmo tūlī nū mu katūmamīle, ūlū tūlīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūtūdūla gete ū kwitūūla ng'wigele līmò na bamò babo, abo bakwikumīlījaga boi benekīlī; nūūlū ni kwilenganīja nabo dūhū yaya. Nguno a boi batamanile; bakūgelelaga kwilenganīja na kwilola boi benekīlī na benekīlī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bise tūtīko kwikumīlīja tūkīlanīje ūmo Mulungu atūgelekelile, nīyo na a bing'we mulīmo ū mu ngelekelo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū aho tūkashika ko kwiza kūmulomeela Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja ng'wa Kilisito, twalī tūtananamīīlaga mu kwihadīkīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūtīko nūūlū kwikumīlīja kūlwa milīmo ya bangī, alīyo tūlī na kwisagīlwa gīkī ū kūzunya kwing'we ūlū kūlashikane, ū nīmo gwise ū kū bing'we gūkūbiza gwabeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū tūkwandya kūjilomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza nū kū mapandī ayo galī kūle na bing'we, gwike tūtatogilwe kwikumīlīja kūlwa nīmo ūyo gwabeejiwa na ūngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ūlū alīho ng'wikumīlīja, ni ikumīlījage mulī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūyo akakumīlījiagwa na Seeba hū ng'wene ūyo asanyiwe na Seeba, atī ūyo akikumīlījaga wei ng'wenekīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
